                                <span class="route-card__min"><em>45</em>мин</span>
                                <span class="route-card__lbl">от мкад<br>на машине</span>
                            </div>
                            <a href="https://yandex.ru/maps/213/moscow/?ll=37.093746%2C55.877213&mode=routes&rtext=55.818974%2C37.390776~55.959175%2C36.947689&rtn=2&rtt=auto&ruri=~ymapsbm1%3A%2F%2Forg%3Foid%3D32660614542&z=10.71" class="btn btn--white route-card__btn" target="_blank">построить маршрут <span class="btn-arrow">→</span></a>
                        </div>
